{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31800","headline":"黄子陂上韩吏部 · 贾岛","name":"黄子陂上韩吏部","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石楼云一别，二十二三春。\n相逐升堂者，几爲埋骨人。\n涕流闻度瘴，病起喜还秦。\n曾是令勤道，非惟恤在迍。\n疎衣蕉缕细，爽味茗芽新。\n钟绝滴残雨，萤多无近邻。\n溪潭承到数，位秩见辞频。\n若个山招隐，机忘任此身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31800.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31800","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}